{"text": " You wake up in 1500 in Tenochtitlan, the island city of the Aztecs, canoes bump along the canals. The market's already loud and it smells of chili and wood smoke. Did you know that here money grows on trees? Cacao beans. The same beans that make chocolate. A priceless from a few decades later says it plainly. One ripe avocado, one bean, a good turkey hen, a hundred. Bigger deals get paid in cotton cloaks. And a Spanish friar wrote about sellers who faked cacao beans, forgery, with chocolate. So what is money to you? Something useful, something you could even drink. You might have heard that money was invented because swapping goats for grain got awkward. Anthropologists say they've never found a whole society that ran on barter alone. People have always found something to count with. But beans are bulky and they rot. Across the ocean, one country's money has the opposite problem. It's so heavy, you need a cart.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.36, "text": " You wake up in 1500 in Tenochtitlan,", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 22671, 294, 314, 5808, 4701, 270, 8658, 11, 50508], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1883454660731038, "compression_ratio": 1.516728624535316, "no_speech_prob": 0.009029119275510311, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12, "probability": 0.5916427969932556}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.28, "probability": 0.9880189299583435}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.46, "probability": 0.9990599751472473}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.56, "probability": 0.9869080781936646}, {"word": " 1500", "start": 0.56, "end": 1.2, "probability": 0.6714361906051636}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.2, "end": 1.64, "probability": 0.7015831470489502}, {"word": " Tenochtitlan,", "start": 1.64, "end": 2.36, "probability": 0.5363633751869201}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.9, "end": 4.4, "text": " the island city of the Aztecs,", "tokens": [50508, 264, 6077, 2307, 295, 264, 7607,